{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Some memories should never be remembered.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After  away from home for many years, Ren returns to his hometown and wakes up in the school, he was expelled. He's trapped here with Kirishima Ryousuke, a friend he once had a problem with. There is something  wrong with this place. The doors are locked. The atmosphere is suffocating. A mysterious shadow resembling a girl named Mizuki. Are they being hunted by a girl they once knew?<br><br><br>Gameplay Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror RPG focused on exploration, storytelling, and puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Solve puzzles to unlock new areas and reveal hidden memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collect the notes to unravel the tragic past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore the area and watch out for something that is chasing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Experience psychological horror through haunting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Two different endings. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains <strong>psychological distress, depictions of death, and disturbing themes</strong>.<br>Player discretion is advised.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077300?t=1762521948","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077300?t=1762521948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077300/4e7721e5e0966d47ce721b3985d0fb48c7bf4bc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762521948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077300/4e7721e5e0966d47ce721b3985d0fb48c7bf4bc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762521948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"